abstract: >-
  A technical concept and architecture specification for reusable software
  components that observe runtime behavior, learn from experience, predict,
  make constrained decisions, and adapt selected aspects of their behavior
  while retaining deterministic fallback behavior. The repository also
  catalogs limited reference examples across frontend, backend, and runtime
  boundaries. The examples illustrate selected principles and do not claim
  to implement the complete LNASF framework or establish general performance
  improvements.
